 "<b style=\"font-size:30px;color:#ffb455\">Bien</b><ul><li>If it rains, I will stay home.</li><li>If I had money…</li><li>If I had known, I would have said something.</li></ul>": "<b style=\"font-size:30px;color:#ffb455\">Juste</b><ul><li>If it rains, I will stay home.</li><li>If I had money…</li><li>If I had known, I would have said something.</li></ul>",
